FMutate expressive controls for Caravel (GPL-3.0-only, preserving upstream attribution).

MIDI polyphonic key pressure (0xAn) controls per-voice square-law gain by source MIDI key
and channel (127 unity skipped = bit-identical, 0 silent), isolated across channels, chord
tones, Harmony / CHORD EXT / LATCH remaps and retriggers, octave-expanded ARP steps, and
deferred engine-switch queues. Ownership comes strictly from live MIDI input paths
(sequencer and panel notes keep unity gain even when a MIDI key of the same pitch is held).
DRONE cells share one network/host voice and intentionally bypass per-note gain.
Existing MIDI pitch bend, velocity, CC120/123 (keep bend) and CC121 (reset bend and pressure)
are preserved; persisted settings and neutral audio are untouched.

